---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Kaine Cohen — CohenHolmes"
  description="Who's behind CohenHolmes — identity and security consulting in Microsoft 365, the move into AI engineering, and the tools and writing built along the way."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <meta slot="head" http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'">

  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>The person behind CohenHolmes</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    I'm Kaine Cohen. I work across identity, security and compliance in Microsoft 365, and
    I'm moving into AI engineering and architecture — building things, not just reading about
    them. This page is the short version of who that is; the blog and the tools below are the
    long version.
  </p>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>What I've built</h2>
    <p>
      The same instinct each time: build the thing I wanted to exist while I was working
      something out myself.
    </p>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/ca-builder">
        <div class="kicker">Tooling</div>
        <p>An interactive Conditional Access Policy Builder — plain-English input, live Microsoft Graph-style JSON out.</p>
        <span class="more">Open the builder →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/ai-governance-check">
        <div class="kicker">AI Governance</div>
        <p>A private, browser-only readiness check across data, identity, governance, agents and human oversight.</p>
        <span class="more">Check your readiness →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/mcp">
        <div class="kicker">For agents</div>
        <p>A read-only MCP server exposing this blog to any AI agent — list posts, fetch the latest, read one in full.</p>
        <span class="more">Connect your agent →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/blog">
        <div class="kicker">Writing</div>
        <p>Notes on identity, security and the move into AI engineering — usually working something out in public.</p>
        <span class="more">Read the blog →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <p class="placeholder-note">
      <!-- SCAFFOLD: replace each entry below with real role, company and dates. -->
      Placeholder structure below — swap in the real roles, companies and dates.
    </p>
    <ol class="timeline">
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-period">[Year–Year]</span>
        <h3>[Role title] <span class="timeline-org">&middot; [Company]</span></h3>
        <p>[One or two lines on what you actually owned or shipped there.]</p>
      </li>
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-period">[Year–Year]</span>
        <h3>[Role title] <span class="timeline-org">&middot; [Company]</span></h3>
        <p>[One or two lines on what you actually owned or shipped there.]</p>
      </li>
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-period">[Year–Year]</span>
        <h3>[Role title] <span class="timeline-org">&middot; [Company]</span></h3>
        <p>[One or two lines on what you actually owned or shipped there.]</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Certifications &amp; focus areas</h2>
    <p>
      Microsoft certified in information protection and compliance (SC-400) and Microsoft 365
      administration (MS-102) — the grounding underneath everything else here.
    </p>
    <ul class="tags">
      <li>Entra ID</li>
      <li>Conditional Access</li>
      <li>Intune</li>
      <li>Purview</li>
      <li>AI governance</li>
      <li>AI engineering</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="contact">
    <h2>Say hello</h2>
    <p>
      Happy to talk identity, security, compliance, or where AI fits into any of them — or about
      any of the above.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://linkedin.com/in/kainecohen" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a>
      <a class="button" href="mailto:kaine.cohen@cohenholmes.co.uk">Email</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .eyebrow{
    margin:0 0 16px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:0.76rem;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent-text);
  }
  .lede{
    max-width:70ch;
    margin-top:18px;
    font-size:clamp(1.02rem, 1.6vw, 1.18rem);
    color:#4A4A5A;
  }

  .block{ margin-top:56px; }
  .block > p{ max-width:72ch; }

  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap:18px;
    margin-top:22px;
  }
  .card{
    background:#FCFAF6;
    border:1px solid #E3DFD3;
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:22px 20px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(15,30,51,0.06);
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .card:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); border-color:var(--accent); }
  .card:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px; }
  .card .kicker{
    font-family:var(--font-body);
    color:var(--accent-text);
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.11em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .card p{ margin:0; color:#4A4A5A; font-size:0.95rem; }
  .card .more{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    color:var(--navy);
  }

  .placeholder-note{
    margin-top:16px;
    padding:12px 16px;
    background:#FDF3E7;
    border:1px dashed var(--accent);
    border-radius:10px;
    font-size:0.9rem;
    color:var(--accent-text);
  }

  .timeline{
    list-style:none;
    margin-top:20px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:20px;
  }
  .timeline-item{
    padding-left:20px;
    border-left:2px solid #E3DFD3;
  }
  .timeline-period{
    display:block;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
    font-size:0.76rem;
    letter-spacing:0.05em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent-text);
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  .timeline-item h3{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-size:1.15rem;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .timeline-org{ font-weight:400; color:#6B6975; }
  .timeline-item p{ margin:0; color:#4A4A5A; font-size:0.95rem; }

  .tags{
    list-style:none;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    margin-top:18px;
  }
  .tags li{
    background:#EDE8DD;
    color:var(--navy);
    border-radius:100px;
    padding:8px 16px;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);
  }

  .actions{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
    margin-top:22px;
  }
  .button{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:11px 18px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:100px;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    font-weight:500;
    border:1px solid #E3DFD3;
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--navy);
    transition:transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .button:hover{ transform:translateY(-1px); border-color:var(--accent); background:#F1E2D6; }
  .button.primary{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:var(--cream);
    border-color:var(--navy);
  }
  .button.primary:hover{ background:var(--accent-text); border-color:var(--accent-text); color:#fff; }
  .button:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px; }
</style>
